WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.977
- [Man] Do you have 
some advice for

00:00:00.977 --> 00:00:04.006
two 16-year-old entrepreneurs?

00:00:04.006 --> 00:00:08.308
- I mean the only 
thing that I think maps

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:11.624
for every 16-year-old
entrepreneur is patience.

00:00:11.624 --> 00:00:14.348
The biggest mistake a
16-year-old entrepreneurs make

00:00:14.348 --> 00:00:16.770
is they want things 
to happen too soon.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.808
You have so much time.

00:00:19.808 --> 00:00:23.123
It's insane to me to think about
how much time you actually have.

00:00:24.725 --> 00:00:26.526
If you doubled your age,

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:28.585
you would still be eight 
years younger than me.

00:00:28.585 --> 00:00:29.496
You know what I mean?

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.198
When you think about it that 
way you have so much time.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:32.299
So I thinkthe biggest thing

00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:35.068
I would tell you is 
use your advantages.

00:00:35.068 --> 00:00:37.571
So you don't have experience 
but you have time.

00:00:37.571 --> 00:00:39.706
What that means is 
put yourself in a position

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:42.943
where you're learning 
and leveraging now

00:00:42.943 --> 00:00:45.045
not cashing in.

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:45.712
You know? 
- [Man] Yeah.

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.215
Don't, you don't 
need the money yet.

00:00:48.215 --> 00:00:49.983
You don't need the fame, yet.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:53.086
Build the foundational pieces
that will make you successful.

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:54.321
Be patient, spend time around

00:00:54.321 --> 00:00:55.923
people that have 
been successful.

00:00:55.923 --> 00:00:56.857
Go look at different things.

00:00:56.857 --> 00:00:59.960
You can commit to seven 
years of just learning

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.079
and still be young as fuck.

00:01:02.079 --> 00:01:03.577
- [Man] Yeah.
- You know?

00:01:03.577 --> 00:01:06.160
Time is your asset, so patience.

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:07.768
- [Man] Great, thank you.
- [Gary] Awesome, man.

